2.  **Splitting:** `snakeCaseString.split('_')` breaks the input string into an array of substrings using the underscore (`_`) as the delimiter.
3.  **Initialization:** `let camelCaseString: string = parts[0];` initializes the result with the very first part of the string, ensuring it starts in lowercase (standard camelCase convention).
